{"meta":{"id":"tt1674782","type":"movie","name":"Karate Kid: Leyendas","imdb_id":"tt1674782","description":"Tras una tragedia familiar, el prodigio del kung fu Li Fong se ve obligado a abandonar su hogar en Pekín y trasladarse a Nueva York con su madre. Li lucha por dejar atrás su pasado mientras intenta encajar con sus nuevos compañeros de clase y, aunque no quiere pelear, los problemas parecen encontrarle en todas partes. Cuando un nuevo amigo necesita su ayuda, Li se presenta a una competición de kárate, pero sus habilidades no son suficientes. El profesor de kung fu de Li, el Sr. Han, pide ayuda al Karate Kid original, Daniel LaRusso, y Li aprende una nueva forma de luchar, fusionando sus dos estilos en uno solo para el enfrentamiento definitivo de artes marciales.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt1674782.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Q2CmqIVJuDAESPPp76rWIiA0AD.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6BEBpypi6kT0HZchQIVR23l537p.png","genres":["Acción","Aventura","Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-05-08T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"94 min","imdbRating":"6.3","country":"United States of America","cast":["Jackie Chan","Ben Wang","Joshua Jackson","Sadie Stanley","Ming-Na Wen","Wyatt Oleff","Aramis Knight","Ralph Macchio","Olivia Yang Avis","Aaron Wang","Nicholas Carella","Shaunette Renée Wilson","Tim Rozon","Mig Buenacruz","Li Li","Henri Forget","Noé Poblete","Oscar Ge","Marco Zhang","Yusuf A. Ahmed","Ruben Maldonado","Jason Hsu","Marcus Aurelio","Christian Jadah","Niko Nikolov","Chance Jones","Mustafa Bulut","Dennis Lafond","Anthony Correa Baniaga Jr.","Richard Chevolleau"],"director":["Jonathan Entwistle"],"writer":["Christopher Murphey","Robert Mark Kamen","Rob Lieber"],"trailers":[{"source":"RMpdjWDaZsw","type":"Trailer","name":"Nuevo Tráiler [Subtitulado]","ytId":"RMpdjWDaZsw","lang":"es"},{"source":"ZWoFMg7XVHA","type":"Trailer","name":"Tráiler O